[00:21.38]Jehovah God is my Shepherd;
[00:26.50]I’ll follow where he will lead.
[00:34.13]He knows my hopes and my heart’s desire;
[00:40.62]He knows what I truly need.
[00:47.42]To watered pastures he leads me,
[00:53.36]To places secure and blessed.
[01:00.44]And he guides me always with loyal love
[01:06.46]To where I find peace and rest.
[01:13.50]He guides me always with loyal love
[01:19.96]To where I find peace and rest.
[01:29.77]Refreshing are all your pathways,
[01:36.04]The ways of your righteousness.
[01:43.16]For your name’s sake never let me stray
